{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"924cd7d428b2e46be33b9f00dc48f13aaa7d98712ac96a96f65b262d5058681e","digest":{"component_or_area":"identity entity and authorship attestation system","key_entities":["identity ticket-type","author (name+email)","author_id","authorship attestation kind","rebar.authorship.v1","DSSE envelope","verify_signature_result.schema.json","{provider, external_id} mapping","identity.require_authenticated","identity.enforce_since","intra_idx (event position)","added_at_commit","revoked_at_commit","verify-identity CLI","create_placeholder()","ssh-agent signing","Jira accountId","Modify-Reporter permission"],"problem_keywords":["authenticated identity","authorship certification","user mapping","provider-neutral","key rotation","TOFU","G2 signing","event attribution","Jira sync","audit trail","non-repudiation"],"propositions":["rebar currently lacks authenticated identity and event attribution; author is an unauthenticated git config string, making operations non-auditable and non-repudiable.","The system must map rebar authenticated identities to external ticket-system users (Jira accountId, later GitHub/Linear) for correct assignee and reporter attribution in sync.","Private key material must never be stored in the repo; authorship signing uses the developer's SSH private key via ssh-agent, with only public keys stored in identity entities.","Key validity is scoped by commit-ancestry era (added_at_commit and revoked_at_commit positions on the tickets branch), with G2 constraint that all non-genesis key changes must be signed by currently-valid keys.","Enforcement is opt-in and detect-on-merged-log: a CI merge-gate job runs verify-identity with --require-authenticated and exits non-zero on unsigned/unverified events at/after the cutover ref; pre-cutover events are grandfathered.","With zero identity configuration, behavior must remain byte-identical to pre-feature: unsigned writes succeed, no identity entity is auto-minted, and list/ready/gates behave identically."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785824992774931055,"uuid":"71c9f268-636f-4934-876a-dc9180dd3278"}